        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Hearing Examiner</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><strong><u><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">SMC Title 18</span></span></span></u></strong></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><strong><u><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Human Rights</span></span></span></u></strong></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=18.01" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">SMC 18.01</span></span></a></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Law Against Discrimination</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=18.02" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">SMC 18.02</span></span></a></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Nondiscrimination in Employment Practices</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=18.03" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">SMC 18.03</span></span></a></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Nondiscrimination in Housing Practices</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=18.06" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">SMC 18.06</span></span></a></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Protections for Persons with Disabilities</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        		<tr>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:100.9pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a href="https://my.spokanecity.org/smc/?Chapter=18.09" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">SMC 18.09</span></span></a></span></p>
        			</td>
        			<td style="vertical-align:top; width:372.25pt">
        			<p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Nuclear Weapons Free Zone</span></span></span></span></p>
        			</td>
        		</tr>
        	</tbody>
        </table>
        
        <ol start="3" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">If a violator is found to be a repeat offender, the violator will be subject to a penalty of $2,500 per violation in addition to the value of the underlying violation if the violation occurred on property whose permitted or primary use is residential as defined in SMC 17C.190.</span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="4" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">If a violator is found to be a repeat offender, the violator will be subject to a penalty of $5,000 per violation in addition to the value of the underlying violation if the violation occurred on property whose permitted or primary use is commercial, industrial, institutional, or other use as defined in SMC 17C.190.</span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="5" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">A repeat offender is defined as an owner and/or occupant of a private property who has one or more committed finding(s) for violation of the regulations set forth or referenced in this chapter, at the same site or on a different tax parcel under the same ownership or occupancy, two times within 12 months from the date of the current violation.</span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 4</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.160">Section 01.05.160</a> REPEALED (Land Use Violation)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 5</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.170">Section 01.05.170</a> REPEALED (Penalty Schedule – Business Regulations)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 6</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.180">Section 01.05.180</a> REPEALED (Penalty Schedule – Use of Streets)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 7</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.190">Section 01.05.190</a> REPEALED (Penalty Schedule – Utilities)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 8</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.200">Section 01.05.200</a> REPEALED (Penalty Schedule – Taxes)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 9</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.210">Section 01.05.210</a> REPEALED (Penalty Schedule)<br />
        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, July 14, 2025</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, August 24, 2025</p><p>ORD C36702 Section 10</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=01.05.220">Section 01.05.220</a> Remedies Not Exclusive<br />
        <p>The levy of a civil penalty is not exclusive and does not preclude other remedies for code violations such as revocation of license or permit, collection of penalties and interest, suspension of municipal service and abatement of nuisance. The failure of a person to comply with an order issued on account of a violation that has been the subject of a civil infraction is a misdemeanor.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 22, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 4, 2007</p><p>Recodification ORD C33969 Section 1</p>				<p><a href="/smc/?Chapter=01.06">Chapter 01.06</a> REPEALED (Law Against Discrimination)</p>
